      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51e2b7ec797957c8",
      "translationZh": "在内存使用达到临界水平时添加了可见警告，并提供释放内存或安全重启的步骤",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ce3befa36c26daf",
      "translationZh": "添加了 CLAUDE_CODE_MCP_STARTUP_WAIT_MS 以限制首次非交互式轮次等待连接 MCP 服务器的时长（0 表示不等待）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7764d4cc6e764095",
