      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b509fb31a6e6e700",
      "translationZh": "添加了 claude_code.managed_settings_resolved OTel 事件：托管设置来源和策略助手状态；在 OTEL_LOG_MANAGED_SETTINGS=1 时对设置和摘要进行脱敏",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59ad9150afecbab7",
      "translationZh": "向 Claude 网关配置添加了 store.connect_timeout_seconds，以延长 Postgres 连接超时（默认 5 秒），并在数据库不可达时改进了启动错误，指向 store.postgres_url 和配置的超时",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d20c1279dfa0b4ed",
