      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71e46a805d517774",
      "translationZh": "当副本打开的请求数超过一次向上游发送的 256 时，Claude 网关会添加警告，并在启动日志中显示该限制",
